  The same path data as ChoirIcons, as a drawable resource.

  Glance composes to RemoteViews, and RemoteViews can only name a drawable by
  id — an ImageVector built in Compose cannot cross into the launcher's
  process. So the widget icons are duplicated here rather than shared, and the
  hand-sketched set that replaces ChoirIcons will have to replace these too.

  Tinted at draw time, so the fill colour below is never seen.
-->
